   "title": "Polymers are distributions, not molecules",
   "text": "A sample holds many chain lengths; averages and dispersity, not one molar mass, describe it."
  },
  {
   "id": "PROPS",
   "title": "Structure sets properties",
   "text": "Cross-links, band gaps and bond stiffness decide whether a material flows, conducts or stretches."
  }
